**/kubeconfig*
**/kubectl
**/*.kubeconfig

# Corporate root CAs for the devcontainer's TLS-intercepted npm mirror.
# Site-specific, so they stay out of a public repo.
.devcontainer/certs/

# Local working notes — currently the AKS migration plan. Deliberately not
